# Line-ending policy: the canonical form in this repo is LF everywhere.
# Without these rules, core.autocrlf on Windows produces mixed CRLF/LF
# working trees (crystal tool format writes LF, checkouts write CRLF),
# which show up as phantom "modified" flags with empty diffs.
* text=auto
*.cr text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.pot text eol=lf
*.po text eol=lf
